QA3 M3. An Unwrap with a value receiver loads its field through a local copy
of the receiver: the copy is the receiver, so a wrapper of another type gives
nothing for it. Only the *W's own inner value is listed, not what the V
elsewhere holds.
-- args --
a.go:@q
-- stdout --
